   "evidence_class": "structurally_derived",
   "confidence": "exact",
   "coverage_note": "Which provider a provider block configures, and where. The settings inside it (region, profile, assume_role) are declarations only: omega-hcl carries a scalar value as an attribute, which the overlay cannot read."
