   "confidence": "candidate",
   "coverage_note": "A declaration pinned to a non-default provider configuration by provider = <provider>.<alias>. The traversal names the alias; its root is the provider local name, which omega-hcl publishes as an attribute, so the selection is stated by alias alone."
