 "coverage": {
  "mode": "explicit-classified",
  "gaps": [
   "provider blocks, required_providers entries, module providers mappings and provider = selections are stated as declarations; every authored value is omitted because omega-hcl publishes a scalar value, a block type label and a traversal root as attributes, and the overlay reads only fields",
   "a resource or data block cannot be attributed to a provider without an explicit provider = argument: the implicit attribution runs from the block type label (aws_instance -> aws), which omega-hcl publishes as an attribute",
   "provider schemas, installed plugin versions, remote credentials/state and runtime/tool execution are external state and are never executed during indexing"
  ]
